---

<Layout title="Download deepin 25" description="Unduh deepin Linux 25.2.0 untuk berbagai arsitektur — AMD64, ARM64, Loong64, RISC-V, dan WSL.">
  <section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-slate-800 to-deepin-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_30%_50%,rgba(26,109,212,0.15)_0%,transparent_50%)]" />
    <div class="container-main relative text-center">
      <img src="/images/deepin-id.png" alt="deepin" width="96" height="96" class="w-24 h-24 mx-auto mb-5 drop-shadow-xl" />
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white">Download <span class="text-deepin-400">deepin</span></h1>
      <p class="mt-3 text-deepin-200 text-lg">Unduh deepin Linux — Sistem Operasi Modern & Cantik</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Headline -->
  <section class="py-6 bg-deepin-50 border-b border-deepin-100">
    <div class="container-main flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-2 text-center">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-deepin-600 text-white text-xs font-semibold"><i class="fas fa-bullhorn text-[10px]" /> RILIS TERBARU</span>
      <p class="text-sm text-deepin-800 font-medium">deepin 25.2.0 kini tersedia! Peningkatan signifikan di Treeland, UOS AI, dan performa.</p>
      <a href="https://news.deepin.id/2026/07/08/deepin-25-2-release/" class="text-sm text-deepin-600 font-semibold hover:underline whitespace-nowrap">Baca selengkapnya <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px] ml-0.5" /></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Version & Tabs -->
  <section class="py-12 bg-white">
    <div class="container-main">
      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-deepin-50 text-deepin-700 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase"><i class="fas fa-star text-[10px]" /> Latest Release</span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-gray-900 mt-3"><span class="text-deepin-600">25.2.0</span></h2>
        <p class="text-gray-500 mt-1">Pilih arsitektur yang sesuai dengan perangkat Anda</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 mb-8">
        {arches.map((a) => (
          <button class={`arch-tab px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-200 ${a.active ? 'bg-deepin-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-deepin-600/25' : 'bg-gray-100 text-gray-600 hover:bg-gray-200'}`} data-arch={a.id}>
            {a.label} <span class="ml-1.5 text-[10px] opacity-60">{a.sub}</span>
          </button>
        ))}
      </div>

      {arches.map((arch) => (
        <div id={`panel-${arch.id}`} class={`arch-panel ${arch.active ? '' : 'hidden'}`}>
          <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mb-6">{arch.desc}</p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 xl:grid-cols-5 gap-3 mb-8">
            {arch.mirrors.map((m) => (
              <a href={m.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="card p-4 group hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300 text-center">
                <i class={`fas ${m.icon.startsWith('fa-brands') ? m.icon : `fa-solid ${m.icon}`} text-xl text-deepin-600 mb-2`} />
                <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-900 text-sm">{m.name}</h3>
                <p class="text-[10px] text-gray-400 mt-0.5">{m.sub}</p>
                <span class="text-xs text-deepin-600 mt-2 inline-flex items-center gap-1 group-hover:underline">Download <i class="fas fa-arrow-right text-[10px]" /></span>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

          {arch.sha256 && (
            <details class="card p-5 max-w-3xl mx-auto text-sm">
              <summary class="cursor-pointer font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-deepin-600 transition-colors"><i class="fas fa-shield-halved mr-2 text-deepin-500" /> Verifikasi ISO</summary>
              <div class="mt-4 space-y-4 text-gray-600">
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3">
                  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase">SHA256</span><pre class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-mono break-all whitespace-pre-wrap">{arch.sha256}</pre></div>
                  <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-3"><span class="font-mono text-[10px] font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase">MD5</span><pre class="mt-1 text-[11px] font-mono break-all whitespace-pre-wrap">{arch.md5}</pre></div>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-deepin-50 rounded-lg p-4 text-xs space-y-2">
                  <p class="font-semibold text-deepin-700"><i class="fas fa-terminal mr-1" />Copy-paste & jalankan di terminal</p>
                  <p class="text-deepin-600">Pilih <strong>salah satu</strong> — SHA256 lebih direkomendasikan:</p>
                  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-deepin-800 break-all"><span class="block text-[10px] text-gray-400 mb-1">SHA256 (disarankan)</span>echo "{arch.sha256} *{arch.iso}" | shasum -a 256 --check</div>
                  <div class="bg-white rounded-lg p-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-deepin-800 break-all"><span class="block text-[10px] text-gray-400 mb-1">MD5</span>echo "{arch.md5} *{arch.iso}" | md5sum --check</div>
                  <p class="text-deepin-600 mt-3">Kamu akan mendapat output seperti ini:</p>
                  <div class="bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-lg p-2.5 font-mono text-[11px] text-green-800">{arch.iso}: OK</div>
                  <p class="text-deepin-600 mt-2">✅ <strong>OK</strong> = file ISO asli, aman, dan tidak korup — siap digunakan.<br />❌ Jika muncul <strong>FAILED</strong>, file rusak atau tidak asli — <strong>jangan digunakan</strong>, download ulang.</p>
                </div>

                <details class="bg-gray-50 rounded-lg p-4">
                  <summary class="cursor-pointer text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700 hover:text-deepin-600"><i class="fas fa-code mr-1" /> Perintah alternatif (Linux / Windows / macOS)</summary>
                  <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-2 mb-3">Jalankan salah satu perintah di bawah, lalu <strong>bandingkan output hash-nya dengan nilai di atas — harus sama persis.</strong></p>
                  <div class="space-y-2 text-[11px]">
                    {[
                      { os: 'Linux — SHA256', cmd: `sha256sum ${arch.iso}` },
                      { os: 'Linux — MD5', cmd: `md5sum ${arch.iso}` },
                      { os: 'Windows PowerShell — SHA256', cmd: `Get-FileHash .\\${arch.iso} -Algorithm SHA256` },
                      { os: 'Windows PowerShell — MD5', cmd: `Get-FileHash .\\${arch.iso} -Algorithm MD5` },
                      { os: 'macOS — SHA256', cmd: `shasum -a 256 ${arch.iso}` },
                      { os: 'macOS — MD5', cmd: `md5 ${arch.iso}` },
                    ].map((alt) => (
                      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center gap-1">
                        <span class="font-semibold text-gray-500 w-48 shrink-0">{alt.os}</span>
                        <code class="bg-white rounded px-2 py-1 font-mono text-gray-800 break-all">{alt.cmd}</code>
                      </div>
                    ))}
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div>
            </details>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-gray-50">
    <div class="container-main text-center">
      <i class="fas fa-circle-question text-3xl text-deepin-300 mb-4" />
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Butuh bantuan instalasi?</h3>
      <p class="text-gray-500 mb-6">Komunitas kami siap membantu kamu di Telegram.</p>
      <a href="https://t.me/Linux_deepin_ID" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-primary"><i class="fab fa-telegram-plane" /> Tanya di Telegram</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<script>
  document.querySelectorAll('.arch-tab').forEach(tab => {
    tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const arch = tab.dataset.arch!;
      document.querySelectorAll('.arch-tab').forEach(t => { t.classList.remove('bg-deepin-600','text-white','shadow-lg','shadow-deepin-600/25'); t.classList.add('bg-gray-100','text-gray-600'); });
      tab.classList.remove('bg-gray-100','text-gray-600');
      tab.classList.add('bg-deepin-600','text-white','shadow-lg','shadow-deepin-600/25');
      document.querySelectorAll('.arch-panel').forEach(p => p.classList.add('hidden'));
      document.getElementById(`panel-${arch}`)?.classList.remove('hidden');
    });
  });
</script>
